{"speciesId":837,"names":{"fr":"Charbi","es":"Rolycoly","en":"Rolycoly","ja":"タンドン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"On l’a découvert dans une mine il y a 400 ans. Son corps est presque entièrement composé d’une substance identique au charbon."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Fue descubierto hace aproximadamente 400 años en una mina. Casi la totalidad de su cuerpo presenta una composición igual a la del carbón."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Most of its body has the same composition as coal. Fittingly, this Pokémon was first discovered in coal mines about 400 years ago."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"およそ４００年前に 炭鉱で 見つかった。 体の ほとんどが 石炭と 同じ 成分。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il parcourt sans difficulté les sentiers rocheux accidentés à la manière d’un monocycle. Il a besoin de brûler du charbon pour vivre."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Recorre incluso los caminos más impracticables y pedregosos como si de un monociclo se tratase. La combustión de carbón es su fuente vital."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It can race around like a unicycle, even on rough, rocky terrain. Burning coal sustains it."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"岩だらけの 悪路を ものともせず 一輪車のように 走りまわる。 石炭を 燃やして 生きている。"}],"varieties":[{"id":837,"moves":[{"name":"tackle","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"dig","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"smokescreen","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"reflect","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"self-destruct","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"explosion","learns":[[20,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rock-slide","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"substitute","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"ma